        "description": {
          "text": "Added new indication for pediatric patients 1 year and older with immune thrombocytopenia (ITP) for at least 6 months with insufficient response to corticosteroids, immunoglobulins, or splenectomy",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for a new indication for Nplate\u00ae (romiplostim) for the treatment of pediatric patients 1 year of age and older with immune thrombocytopenia (ITP) for at least 6 months who have had an insufficient response to corticosteroids, immunoglobulins, or splenectomy.",
